---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-09 - Set Up a Consent Purpose
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STW as Data Protection Steward
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as ConsentPurposesController
    participant S as ConsentPurposeService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STW->>W: Create purpose "Wellbeing support"
    W->>C: POST /api/ConsentPurposes {purposeName, description}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: CreateAsync(purpose, status = inactive)
    R->>DB: INSERT CONSENTPURPOSES
    loop each attribute to cover
        W->>C: POST /api/ConsentPurposes/purpose-attributes {consentPurposeId, dataAttributeId}
        C->>S: CreatePurposeAttributeAsync(request)
        S->>R: Check the attribute is active and not attached yet
        S->>R: Add link, SaveAsync()
        R->>DB: INSERT PURPOSE_ATTRIBUTE
    end
    W->>C: PUT /api/ConsentPurposes/{id}/activate
    C->>S: ActivateAsync(ConsentPurposeId)
    alt no active attribute attached
        S-->>C: ValidationException
        C-->>W: 400 Bad Request
    else
        S->>R: UpdateAsync(status = active)
        R->>DB: UPDATE CONSENTPURPOSES
        S-->>C: true
        C-->>W: 200 OK
    end
